# Copy to .env.local for local development. Never commit real values.

# ── Site ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Public base URL, no trailing slash. Canonical URLs, Open Graph, sitemap.
# Local: optional (defaults to http://localhost:3000 in `next dev`).
# Vercel: optional. Derived from Vercel's own URLs (production domain, or the
# preview URL). Set it in the Vercel project once her own domain is live.
# Anywhere else (local `next build`, CI): REQUIRED. The build fails without it.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# That's the only variable. The site has no form, email service or database
# (client decision, 2026-11-13): enquiries go straight to WhatsApp or open a
# Gmail compose window addressed to her. Contact details live in
# src/lib/site.ts.
